00:39:50.620 --> 00:39:54.860
So they did a study at the University of Liverpool.

967
00:39:55.240 --> 00:39:55.700
Okay.

968
00:39:56.040 --> 00:40:08.860
They recruited 110 women between the ages of 18 and 35, and they gave these women T-shirts that men had worn overnight, and it had different men's scents on them.

