They found that the women tended to be attracted to people with an MHC that was dissimilar to their own.

976
00:40:36.520 --> 00:40:44.040
And they concluded that's because it would be beneficial to mate with someone who is most genetically different from you,

977
00:40:44.060 --> 00:40:49.140
because you're less likely to share genetic defects that you would pass along to your children.

978
00:40:49.320 --> 00:40:49.920
Oh, my God.

