00:41:04.280 --> 00:41:09.860
Well, they wanted to test the effect of birth control pills on our ability to smell out a good mate.

989
00:41:10.440 --> 00:41:13.880
So, at first, none of the women were taking birth control.

990
00:41:14.160 --> 00:41:15.540
And they could smell better?

991
00:41:15.760 --> 00:41:19.320
They could smell out a mate that was dissimilar from them.

