00:41:19.460 --> 00:41:21.000
And then when they got on birth control?

993
00:41:21.180 --> 00:41:21.500
Mm-hmm.

994
00:41:21.620 --> 00:41:23.800
It changed, it dulled their senses or something?

995
00:41:23.960 --> 00:41:26.400
It changed who they were attracted to.

996
00:41:26.780 --> 00:41:27.120
Oh.

997
00:41:27.920 --> 00:41:35.300
Suddenly, women were attracted to the smells of men who were more genetically similar.

998
00:41:35.760 --> 00:41:44.680
In general, the effects of the study said if you meet someone while taking birth control and then you stop it,

999
00:41:44.700 --> 00:41:50.640
or if you meet someone not taking birth control and you start it, it might affect your attraction to them

1000
00:41:50.640 --> 00:41:54.280
because you smell different.

1001
00:41:54.720 --> 00:41:56.400
You're attracted to a different thing.

1002
00:41:57.820 --> 00:41:58.940
That's fascinating.

