00:41:59.640 --> 00:42:08.360
There was a study in Psychological Science of 365 couples that found that women who went on the pill during a relationship

1004
00:42:08.360 --> 00:42:14.580
were now suddenly less sexually satisfied than women who had been consistently on the pill or never on the pill.

