00:54:38.900 --> 00:54:39.140
Yeah.

1280
00:54:39.320 --> 00:54:41.320
He's like, yeah, I heard you say it to Phyllis.

1281
00:54:41.460 --> 00:54:42.000
It's a great line.

1282
00:54:42.100 --> 00:54:42.560
It's a good one.

1283
00:54:42.720 --> 00:54:42.800
Yeah.

1284
00:54:43.060 --> 00:54:43.240
Yeah.

1285
