Pam is going to start passing out the ballots for the costume conteSt.

1286
00:54:47.380 --> 00:54:51.140
And she explains that you cannot vote for yourself.

1287
00:54:51.540 --> 00:54:52.000
Mm-hmm.

1288
00:54:52.600 --> 00:54:54.180
