1295
00:55:04.220 --> 00:55:04.420
Yeah.

1296
00:55:05.020 --> 00:55:06.620
Pam says this is a bad idea.

1297
00:55:06.620 --> 00:55:08.660
When has this ever worked for you?

1298
00:55:08.660 --> 00:55:10.280
That's a line I appreciated.

1299
00:55:10.540 --> 00:55:11.840
Michael says never.

1300
00:55:13.660 --> 00:55:18.900
He's so bummed out that Daryl went behind his back to Gabe, and he's just acting like

1301
00:55:18.900 --> 00:55:19.440
