1308
00:55:40.340 --> 00:55:47.020
And I recently got a picture of me and Vartan judging the Halloween costume conteSt.

1309
00:55:47.200 --> 00:55:48.760
One year, I got to be the guest judge.

1310
00:55:48.860 --> 00:55:52.620
He would always judge, and he would have a guest judge, and I got to do it.

1311
00:55:52.680 --> 00:55:55.220
And I'll give that to you, Angela, so you can post it.

1312
00:55:55.280 --> 00:55:56.120
It's really cool.

1313
00:55:56.360 --> 00:55:57.060
I love it.

1314
00:55:57.680 --> 00:56:02.640
Well, we're going to have our fourth costume change, which is Angela has gone from the penguin

1315
00:56:03.440 --> 00:56:05.000
to the sexy nurse.

1316
00:56:05.700 --> 00:56:08.660
She has a talking head where she says, I don't like your tone.

1317
00:56:08.880 --> 00:56:11.540
Look, they were sold out of all the other costumes, okay?

1318
00:56:11.900 --> 00:56:14.100
I think we all live in the real world here.

1319
00:56:14.480 --> 00:56:17.340
Let's not pretend to be unaware of what sells in this office.

1320
00:56:18.100 --> 00:56:23.900
Let me say, as your best friend, being on set with you while you wore that costume, it

1321
00:56:23.900 --> 00:56:24.820
was very skimpy.

1322
00:56:24.820 --> 00:56:27.780
I kind of can't believe it made it on the air.

1323
00:56:28.240 --> 00:56:29.080
It was.

1324
00:56:29.520 --> 00:56:31.400
You were wearing like nothing.

1325
00:56:31.820 --> 00:56:32.500
Truly.

1326
00:56:32.940 --> 00:56:33.940
I could not bend over.

1327
00:56:34.220 --> 00:56:34.640
No.

1328
00:56:34.740 --> 00:56:40.120
I had little mesh biker shorts on because I didn't want to, you know, ruin the mystery.

1329
00:56:40.540 --> 00:56:46.600
I had little high heels on and these like stockings, a tiny little dress.

1330
00:56:46.920 --> 00:56:53.120
And then Alicia brought me a box of the chicken cutlet boobs, you know?

1331
00:56:53.260 --> 00:56:53.460
Yep.

1332
00:56:53.460 --> 00:56:55.440
And we played with a few different sizes.

1333
