I want you to know the first size that they had for me, I would have looked like Dolly

1334
00:57:00.840 --> 00:57:01.280
Parton.

1335
00:57:02.680 --> 00:57:03.920
I love you, Dolly.

1336
00:57:04.140 --> 00:57:06.760
I wasn't ready to be full Dolly Parton.

1337
00:57:07.400 --> 00:57:10.020
I said, can we scale back on the cutlet size?

1338
00:57:10.020 --> 00:57:14.360
Well, the very odd thing was that they recycled the nurse costume.

1339
00:57:14.540 --> 00:57:14.760
Yeah.

1340
00:57:15.140 --> 00:57:19.500
The same costume that Jackie DeBotton wore when she held up the big check for science.

1341
00:57:19.860 --> 00:57:20.220
Yeah.

1342
00:57:20.400 --> 00:57:21.860
It was the exact same one.

1343
00:57:22.020 --> 00:57:25.500
I think they just had to trim the length a little for me.

1344
00:57:25.760 --> 00:57:27.220
Well, they trimmed it too much.

1345
00:57:27.220 --> 00:57:27.920
They might have.

1346
00:57:27.980 --> 00:57:28.680
They really did.

1347
00:57:28.680 --> 00:57:29.580
It was so short.

1348
00:57:29.580 --> 00:57:35.320
I will tell you that Kim Ferry, who did my hair on the show, we had so much fun because

1349
00:57:35.320 --> 00:57:37.260
I got to have like fun, sassy hair.

1350
00:57:37.480 --> 00:57:37.640
Yeah.

1351
00:57:38.100 --> 00:57:42.100
And just so you know, I would take the penguin costume over that any day because the penguin

1352
00:57:42.100 --> 00:57:44.360
costume was like wearing a sleeping bag.

1353
00:57:44.360 --> 00:57:47.140
There were so many different costumes at Dunder Mifflin.

1354
00:57:47.280 --> 00:57:48.180
Jenna, it made me curious.

1355
00:57:48.180 --> 00:57:50.860
What was the most popular Halloween costume last year?

1356
00:57:51.320 --> 00:57:53.840
Oh, so I went and looked it up.

1357
00:57:53.960 --> 00:57:55.400
I was a lady who Googled.

1358
00:57:55.620 --> 00:57:57.640
We did a lot of Googling in this episode.

1359
00:57:57.640 --> 00:57:58.360
