1366
00:58:13.160 --> 00:58:14.860
Number five, Cruella DeVille.

1367
00:58:15.060 --> 00:58:16.080
Number six, fairy.

1368
00:58:16.460 --> 00:58:18.000
Number seven, Harley Quinn.

1369
00:58:18.320 --> 00:58:19.460
Number eight, cowboy.

1370
00:58:19.960 --> 00:58:21.100
Number nine, clown.

1371
00:58:21.380 --> 00:58:22.280
Number 10, Chucky.

